OL,3,GNEWSABritish soldier charged with rape
OL,4,Aof woman serving in Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British soldier has been charged with
OL,7,Fthe rape of a woman serving with the UK
OL,8,Farmed forces in Cyprus.
OL,10,FL/Cpl Nicholas Horne, who serves in the
OL,11,F4th Battalion of the Royal Regiment of
OL,12,FScotland ` also known as the
OL,13,FHighlanders ` was charged with one
OL,14,Fcount of rape on 23 October, the
OL,15,FDefence Serious Crime Command (DSCC)
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FHe was arrested on 19 October, two days
OL,19,Fafter the DSCC was informed of the
OL,20,Falleged rape of a woman serving in the
OL,21,FBritish Forces Cyprus, which is part of
OL,22,Fthe British armed forces.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
